# Paths the loop may propose changes to but must not merge.
#
# CHARTER.md rule 13 says the charter, the workflow definitions, and the
# loop's own prompt are human-owned. This file is what makes that true
# rather than merely stated: with branch protection requiring code-owner
# review on these paths, a pull request touching any of them will not
# auto-merge however green its checks are.
#
# This file is itself covered by the /.github/ rule below, so the loop
# cannot remove its own constraints by editing this list.

/CHARTER.md   @addicted2ai
/.github/     @addicted2ai
/prompts/     @addicted2ai
